{"id": "3106387", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3106387", "title": "\u0218ablenski ezeren kompleks", "text": "\u0218ablenski ezeren kompleks este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Bulgaria \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului \u0218ablenski ezeren kompleks este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul \u0218ablenski ezeren kompleks a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 156 de specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunile Marea Neagr\u0103 \u0219i marin\u0103 a M\u0103rii Negre, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (156): uliu cu picioare scurte (\"Accipiter brevipes\"), uliu p\u0103s\u0103rar (\"Accipiter nisus\"), privighetoare-de-balt\u0103 (\"Acrocephalus melanopogon\"), fluierar de munte (\"Actitis hypoleucos\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 albastru (\"Alcedo atthis\"), ra\u021b\u0103 suli\u021bar (\"Anas acuta\"), ra\u021b\u0103 lingurar (\"Anas clypeata\"), ra\u021b\u0103 pitic\u0103 (\"Anas crecca\"), ra\u021b\u0103 fluier\u0103toare (\"Anas penelope\"), ra\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anas platyrhynchos\"), ra\u021b\u0103 c\u00e2r\u00e2itoare (\"Anas querquedula\"), ra\u021b\u0103 pestri\u021b\u0103 (\"Anas strepera\"), g\u00e2rli\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anser albifrons\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 cenu\u0219ie (\"Anser anser\"), g\u00e2rli\u021b\u0103 mic\u0103 (\"Anser erythropus\"), g\u00e2sc\u0103 de sem\u0103n\u0103tur\u0103 (\"Anser fabalis\"), cocor mic (\"Anthropoides virgo\"), f\u00e2s\u0103-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Anthus campestris\"), acvil\u0103 \u021bip\u0103toare mare (\"Aquila clanga\"), acvil\u0103 \u021bip\u0103toare mic\u0103 (\"Aquila pomarina\"), st\u00e2rc cenu\u0219iu (\"Ardea cinerea\"), st\u00e2rc ro\u0219u (\"Ardea p